  "chain": "PS-3-2011 faulted (stripped screw, water intrusion) [cause TBD] -> CV-3-2011 inadvertently opens -> Medium Runback auto-initiates -> feedwater/steam demand mismatch (unaccounted design input) -> 3C S/G level rises to manual trip limit -> manual reactor trip [backup AFW]; separately, broken wire trips MOV-3-1432 relays -> lost position indication -> operator manually closes MSIVs -> contributes to trip response",
  "golden_questions": [
